{"lines":[{"w":0.72016459147135414,"t":"A study in the American Journal of Health Behavior showed that when women with obesity","h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.067901243134240966,"y":0.082744405229144169,"c":1},{"t":"did Zumba three times a week for 16 weeks, they lost an average of 1.2 kilos and lowered","c":1,"h":0.016003780005537038,"w":0.71604939778645837,"x":0.06995884009854042,"y":0.098837209156338313},{"y":0.11482558126268638,"w":0.73456792195638021,"h":0.014534883982160851,"x":0.067901224104694027,"t":"their percentage of body fat by 1%. More importantly, the women enjoyed the class so much","c":1},{"t":"that they made it a habit and continued to attend classes at least once a week - very unusual","h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"x":0.069958852544763583,"w":0.74485595703125007,"y":0.1292697288663569},{"c":1,"y":0.14389534867069198,"h":0.015998644317698929,"x":0.067901241023051118,"t":"for an aerobic exercise programme.","w":0.29012344360351561},{"w":0.70173797607421862,"x":0.069906888874584044,"y":0.16700539064671227,"t":"Dance is never going to compete with high-intensity workouts when it comes to physical","c":1,"h":0.017451147027796376},{"x":0.069958852970872412,"t":"fitness gains, but its popularity is likely to keep on rising because it's such a fun way to","y":0.18459302310973646,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"w":0.68724278767903646},{"h":0.016654007847654584,"y":0.19879508907376098,"w":0.068209489186604813,"t":"keep fit.","x":0.06774710715858305,"c":1},{"x":0.84773662552926021,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"t":"Test 2","y":0.0376914013748747,"w":0.061728394826253252},{"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186143,"y":0.082848837050869206,"t":"Q39","h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.83950617345591094},{"y":0.12786174837193842,"h":0.014625340384223806,"c":1,"t":"Q40","x":0.8394742337326202,"w":0.041216141382853233},{"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"109","y":0.90988372077179935,"x":0.87242798414263956},{"w":0.25054743448893235,"x":0.7192988450615